    "description": {
      "value": "<p>以一个动作，你可以对距你30尺内的一名可见生物挥舞这张卡片，并尝试将其变成石头。目标必须成功通过一次DC 17的体质豁免，否则它开始变成石头并被束缚。受影响的目标必须在其下一轮结束时重新进行豁免。豁免成功时，目标身上的此效果结束。豁免失败时，目标被石化，直到通过<em>高等复原术greater restoration</em>或类似法术将石化移除为止。这一特性一经使用，直到次日黎明之前无法再次使用。</p><p>As an action, you can brandish this card at one creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself and attempt to turn it to stone. The target must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=17]] saving throw, or it begins to turn to stone and has the &amp;Reference[condition=restrained] condition. The affected target must repeat the saving throw at the end of its next turn. On a successful save, the effect ends on the target. On a failed save, the target has the &amp;Reference[condition=petrified] condition (instead of the &amp;Reference[condition=restrained] condition) until it is removed by the @spell[Greater Restoration] spell or similar magic. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p>",
